{
 "source": "trapp",
 "book": "2CH",
 "chapter": 9,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.1",
   "range": "2CH.9.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8153257f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.1#p1-8153257f",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 10:1. Saba forte α σεβομαι, for the plenty of frankincense and sweet odours there.",
     "anchor": "And when the queen of Sheba.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:1",
       "ref": "1KI.10.1"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.2",
   "range": "2CH.9.2",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "edb9bcf6",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.2#p1-edb9bcf6",
     "text": "Which were not of those curious and frivolous ones condemned by St Paul: but weighty and necessary, concerning God and his providence, concerning sin, good works, life eternal, &c., questions also political and moral.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon told her all her questions."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.3",
   "range": "2CH.9.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5fdc991c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.3#p1-5fdc991c",
     "text": "1Ki 10:4.",
     "anchor": "Had seen the wisdom of Solomon.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:4",
       "ref": "1KI.10.4"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.4",
   "range": "2CH.9.4",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5fd9771c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.4#p1-5fd9771c",
     "text": "1Ki 10:5.",
     "anchor": "And their apparel",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:5",
       "ref": "1KI.10.5"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.5",
   "range": "2CH.9.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "39197b77",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.5#p1-a4563618",
     "text": "Praeclare de ipso loquitur. Lipsius conqueritur - an Iustus ipse viderit - desiisse homines non mode laudanda facere, sed laudare. {a} Praise worthy persons are not to be defrauded of their due praises. \"If any virtue, if any praise.\" {Php 4:8}",
     "anchor": "It was a true report.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Php 4:8",
       "ref": "PHP.4.8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.5#p2-f6422de9",
     "text": "{a} Lib. ii. epist. 70."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.6",
   "range": "2CH.9.6",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "070a2a03",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.6#p1-070a2a03",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:7.",
     "anchor": "For thou exceedest, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:7",
       "ref": "1KI.10.7"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.7",
   "range": "2CH.9.7",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "425e5672",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.7#p1-425e5672",
     "text": "Those that saw Christ in the flesh had therein a happiness; {Mat 13:17} how much more such as see him in heaven! See on 1Ki 10:8.",
     "anchor": "Which stand continually before thee.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Mat 13:17",
       "ref": "MAT.13.17"
      },
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:8",
       "ref": "1KI.10.8"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.8",
   "range": "2CH.9.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "b0a08674",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.8#p1-b0a08674",
     "text": "She speaketh of the spiritual Israel.",
     "anchor": "To establish them for ever."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.9",
   "range": "2CH.9.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5dc0dd0f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.9#p1-5dc0dd0f",
     "text": "See 1Ki 9:14.",
     "anchor": "And she gave the king.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 9:14",
       "ref": "1KI.9.14"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.10",
   "range": "2CH.9.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "fa7ea7f4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.10#p1-640af084",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:11.",
     "anchor": "And the servants also of Huram.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:11",
       "ref": "1KI.10.11"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.10#p2-4881ae02",
     "text": "Not corals, as some would have it, but brazil wood, or rather ebony.",
     "anchor": "Brought algum trees."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.12",
   "range": "2CH.9.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "9e46d7d2",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.12#p1-e2a4a7b4",
     "text": "1Ki 10:13.",
     "anchor": "And king Solomon gave to the queen.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:13",
       "ref": "1KI.10.13"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.12#p2-5e5f32d8",
     "text": "i.e., Besides that which he gave her in exchange or requital of her presents, he added many more thereunto, out of his own mere bounty and liberality; even the greatest rarities of his country. Munster’s translation therefore is not to be admitted, Sed non tantum quantum illa attulit regi. Ingenuous spirits love not to lie behind in their courteous retributions.",
     "anchor": "Besides that which she had brought unto the king"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.13",
   "range": "2CH.9.13",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "64011284",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.13#p1-64011284",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:14.",
     "anchor": "Now the weight.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:14",
       "ref": "1KI.10.14"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.14",
   "range": "2CH.9.14",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "4064edbb",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.14#p1-4064edbb",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:15-17, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:15-17",
       "ref": "1KI.10.15-17"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.17",
   "range": "2CH.9.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6fc628a4",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.17#p1-6fc628a4",
     "text": "See on 1Ki 10:18.",
     "anchor": "Moreover the king made.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:18",
       "ref": "1KI.10.18"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.18",
   "range": "2CH.9.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "d6f60276",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.18#p1-d6f60276",
     "text": "Haec omnia fuerunt mystica. All about this throne was mystical and significative.",
     "anchor": "And there were six steps."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.19-23",
   "range": "2CH.9.19-23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "be06ac54",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.19-23#p1-be06ac54",
     "text": "] See 1Ki 10:20-22, &c.",
     "verse": 19,
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:20-22",
       "ref": "1KI.10.20-22"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.25",
   "range": "2CH.9.25",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "49319584",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.25#p1-49319584",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:26.",
     "anchor": "And Solomon had, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:26",
       "ref": "1KI.10.26"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.26",
   "range": "2CH.9.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "289b9609",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.26#p1-289b9609",
     "text": "See 1Ki 4:21.",
     "anchor": "And he reigned.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 4:21",
       "ref": "1KI.4.21"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.27",
   "range": "2CH.9.27",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "f40ddaba",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.27#p1-f40ddaba",
     "text": "That grow in every hedgerow.",
     "anchor": "That are in the low plains."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.28",
   "range": "2CH.9.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "491d7584",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.28#p1-491d7584",
     "text": "See 1Ki 10:28.",
     "anchor": "And they brought.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 10:28",
       "ref": "1KI.10.28"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "trapp/2CH.9.29",
   "range": "2CH.9.29",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "6e8b706d",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.29#p1-20941651",
     "text": "And worst. See 1Ki 11:41.",
     "anchor": "Now the rest, &c.",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ki 11:41",
       "ref": "1KI.11.41"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.29#p2-1b5f1253",
     "text": "His first were best: of his last this historian saith nothing, but layeth his finger on the scar.",
     "anchor": "First and last."
    },
    {
     "id": "trapp/2CH.9.29#p3-91b4ecb1",
     "text": "In part of the First Book of Kings, written by these three prophets.",
     "anchor": "In the book of Nathan."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
